        "Content": "<ul><li>Recently renovated internally</li><li>Small yard to the rear</li><li>Mains services</li><li>Excellent central location within Clonmel town centre</li><li>Convenient access to all local amenities</li><li>Only 850 Meters From Tipperary University Hospital</ul>"
